SUMMARY:Thank Comedy It's Friday Late Night Stand Up Show LIVE at The Comic
	 Strip
DTSTAMP:20260809T040753Z
DTSTART:20260807T220000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nKick off the weeken
	d with the funniest stand-up comedy show around at the iconic Comic Strip 
	Live. “Thank Comedy It’s Friday” is the perfect way to shake off the week 
	and dive into the weekend with a smile. \nCatch hilarious sets from top co
	medians seen on Netflix\, HBO\, Comedy Central\, BET\, and viral social me
	dia platforms. Enjoy a live show soundtrack provided by DJ E.M. to keep th
	e energy high all night long. \nEvent Details\nDate: Every Friday Night\nT
	ime: Doors at 10:00 PM\, Showtime at 10:30 PM\nLocation: Comic Strip Live\
	, 1568 2nd Avenue\, New York\, NY 10028\nAge Requirement: 21+ with valid I
	D\nNote: A two-item minimum purchase per person is required at the event \
	nAbout the Venue\nThe Comic Strip is one of New York City’s most iconic co
	medy clubs\, located at 1568 2nd Avenue on the Upper East Side. Accessible
	 via the 77th St (6 train) and 86th St (Q train) subway stations. \nWhat t
	o Expect\nBring your friends\, grab a drink\, and enjoy an evening packed 
	with jokes\, good vibes\, and great company. The show features talent from
	 Netflix and Comedy Central with DJ E.M. keeping the energy high between s
	ets. It’s the ultimate Friday night out in NYC. \nTicket Information\nGene
	ral Admission tickets are $25.00. No booking fees. Age 21+ with valid ID r
	equired. Two-item minimum purchase per person at the event. \nGet Tickets\
	n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/thank-comedy-its-friday-late-night-sta
	nd-up-show-live-at-the-comic-strip-2/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/thank-comedy-its-friday-late-night-sta
	nd-up-show-live-at-the-comic-strip-2/
