	ckets\nResale Tickets\nSara Huntington LIVE at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa
	\nCatch Sara Huntington live at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa for a Thursday
	 night of sharp\, engaging stand-up comedy. Known for her clever humor and
	 captivating stage presence\, Sara Huntington is a rising comedian who del
	ivers a memorable performance every time she takes the stage. \nEvent Deta
	ils\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open 6:00 PM)
	\nVenue: Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 6808 S Memorial Dr\, Ste. 2
	34\, Tulsa\, OK 74133\nAge Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket Price: $22 \nAbou
	t Sara Huntington\nSara Huntington is a stand-up comedian known for her sh
	arp wit\, clever observations\, and engaging storytelling. She has perform
	ed at comedy clubs and venues across the country\, building a following wi
	th her authentic\, relatable humor. Sara’s comedy draws from real-life exp
	eriences and delivers laughs with intelligence and heart. \nWhat to Expect
	\n\nSharp\, clever stand-up comedy with engaging storytelling\nRelatable h
	umor that resonates with diverse audiences\nWitty observations on everyday
	 life\nIntimate Thursday night show at Loony Bin Tulsa\nFull bar and dinin
	g available during the show\n\nVenue Information\nLoony Bin Comedy Club Tu
	lsa at 6808 S Memorial Dr\, Ste. 234 is Tulsa’s heart for live stand-up co
	medy. With no seat more than 50 feet from the stage\, a full bar\, and a c
	omplete dining menu\, it’s the perfect spot for a weeknight comedy outing.
	 \nTicket Information\nTickets for Sara Huntington at Loony Bin Comedy Clu
	b Tulsa are just $22. Purchase directly through the Loony Bin website. \nO
